  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">La tarde de este viernes han acabado en el auditorio de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda las audiciones del alumnado de ense&ntilde;anzas elementales del Centro de Estudios Musicales, con las dedicadas a piano.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/03/IMG_1483.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">El final de la audici&oacute;n ha sido la interpretaci&oacute;n por ocho j&oacute;venes en un solo piano de Titanic.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciopianograuelemental16/img_1390.jpg\" alt=\"img_1390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciopianograuelemental16/img_1391.jpg\" alt=\"img_1391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciopianograuelemental16/img_1393.jpg\" alt=\"img_1393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciopianograuelemental16/img_1394.jpg\" alt=\"img_1394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciopianograuelemental16/img_1397.jpg\" alt=\"img_1397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciopianograuelemental16/img_1398.jpg\" alt=\"img_1398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciopianograuelemental16/img_1400.jpg\" alt=\"img_1400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25